  "content_html": "<p>In early March 2023, I had a debate with Keith Teare, hosted by the organization Open to Debate, on the question of whether ChatGPT would do more harm than good. I think about that question a lot, nearly every day. </p><div id=\"youtube2-xK35NH3UL1c\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;xK35NH3UL1c&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"></div></div><p>Right now, the <em>negative</em> argument against generative AI&#8212;the ledger of bad things&#8212;is quite serious. We have nonconsensual deep fake porn, a rise in phishing scams, wholesale disinformation, cognitive surrender, threats to democracy from the subtle influence of governments on LLMs, not to mention the use of generative AI as a surveillance tool. And the effects of all that IP theft on artists and writers, and potential negative effects more broadly across the employment market (though, mercifully, these have been more modest than some people expected).</p><p>And then there is the deluge of hacks that some have called &#8220;Black October&#8221;.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!abiX!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24009919-6a50-499d-8324-1a93ea5f6b4e_1183x1080.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!abiX!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24009919-6a50-499d-8324-1a93ea5f6b4e_1183x1080.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!abiX!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24009919-6a50-499d-8324-1a93ea5f6b4e_1183x1080.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!abiX!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24009919-6a50-499d-8324-1a93ea5f6b4e_1183x1080.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!abiX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24009919-6a50-499d-8324-1a93ea5f6b4e_1183x1080.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!abiX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24009919-6a50-499d-8324-1a93ea5f6b4e_1183x1080.png\" width=\"1183\" height=\"1080\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/24009919-6a50-499d-8324-1a93ea5f6b4e_1183x1080.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1183,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:231565,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/221953165?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24009919-6a50-499d-8324-1a93ea5f6b4e_1183x1080.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!abiX!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24009919-6a50-499d-8324-1a93ea5f6b4e_1183x1080.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!abiX!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24009919-6a50-499d-8324-1a93ea5f6b4e_1183x1080.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!abiX!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24009919-6a50-499d-8324-1a93ea5f6b4e_1183x1080.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!abiX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24009919-6a50-499d-8324-1a93ea5f6b4e_1183x1080.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Paul Kedrosky just dubbed it <a href=\"https://paulkedrosky.com/the-hackening-has-begun/\">The Hackening</a>. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utVx!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f214260-8162-4f0f-8678-27f6427ddfff_904x764.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utVx!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f214260-8162-4f0f-8678-27f6427ddfff_904x764.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utVx!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f214260-8162-4f0f-8678-27f6427ddfff_904x764.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utVx!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f214260-8162-4f0f-8678-27f6427ddfff_904x764.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utVx!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f214260-8162-4f0f-8678-27f6427ddfff_904x764.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utVx!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f214260-8162-4f0f-8678-27f6427ddfff_904x764.png\" width=\"904\" height=\"764\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7f214260-8162-4f0f-8678-27f6427ddfff_904x764.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:764,&quot;width&quot;:904,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:117437,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/221953165?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f214260-8162-4f0f-8678-27f6427ddfff_904x764.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utVx!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f214260-8162-4f0f-8678-27f6427ddfff_904x764.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utVx!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f214260-8162-4f0f-8678-27f6427ddfff_904x764.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utVx!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f214260-8162-4f0f-8678-27f6427ddfff_904x764.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utVx!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f214260-8162-4f0f-8678-27f6427ddfff_904x764.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Marc Benioff, Salesforce&#8217;s CEO, called it a &#8220;Code red&#8221;, amplifying a dark tweet from Anthropic&#8217;s Jason Clinton. I think both are right. (Though, to be sure, Clinton thinks this awful period might last only a year or two.)</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/benioff/status/2113407312866197954?s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Jason is 100% right. Code red. &#128680;&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;Benioff&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Marc Benioff&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1978181723356884992/VIhB1Jru_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-10-22T23:09:03.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;as bad as things have gotten in the past 4 days, they are going to get a lot worse before they get better. security leaders, never let a crisis go to waste: please go to your boards and ask for help right now. not for ai, for the basics. (we need to hold on for ~18 months.)&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;JasonDClinton&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Jason D. Clinton &#128312;&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1836256630121598976/D4QeJuxW_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[]},&quot;reply_count&quot;:89,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:159,&quot;like_count&quot;:2014,&quot;impression_count&quot;:844109,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>&#167;</p><p>But what about the positive side? Are all these risks worth taking? Torsten Slok, chief economist at Apollo Global Management, at times fairly positive about the technology, just made a brutal case that <a href=\"https://substack.com/redirect/2b7dde97-42c3-4c76-80cd-9c9cc1b6bd99?j=eyJ1IjoiMzVkcWsifQ.yi9LRR8jupnvTggCpXFOSyuOPrUzk4sHp0jppt5ve78\">many of the positive effects we were led to expect simply aren&#8217;t materializing</a>:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S0Nf!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08003006-fcf9-476d-854d-9439ae8665b5_2398x1354.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S0Nf!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08003006-fcf9-476d-854d-9439ae8665b5_2398x1354.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S0Nf!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08003006-fcf9-476d-854d-9439ae8665b5_2398x1354.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S0Nf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08003006-fcf9-476d-854d-9439ae8665b5_2398x1354.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S0Nf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08003006-fcf9-476d-854d-9439ae8665b5_2398x1354.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S0Nf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08003006-fcf9-476d-854d-9439ae8665b5_2398x1354.png\" width=\"2398\" height=\"1354\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/08003006-fcf9-476d-854d-9439ae8665b5_2398x1354.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1354,&quot;width&quot;:2398,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:403647,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/221953165?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8ef6a896-b6ba-439d-abba-f92829e0ad01_2398x1534.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S0Nf!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08003006-fcf9-476d-854d-9439ae8665b5_2398x1354.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S0Nf!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08003006-fcf9-476d-854d-9439ae8665b5_2398x1354.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S0Nf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08003006-fcf9-476d-854d-9439ae8665b5_2398x1354.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S0Nf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08003006-fcf9-476d-854d-9439ae8665b5_2398x1354.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>You can read the full thing <a href=\"https://substack.com/redirect/2b7dde97-42c3-4c76-80cd-9c9cc1b6bd99?j=eyJ1IjoiMzVkcWsifQ.yi9LRR8jupnvTggCpXFOSyuOPrUzk4sHp0jppt5ve78\">here</a>.</p><p>It ain&#8217;t over yet. And I certainly have friends who have gotten a lot out of generative AI (mainly for coding), but at this point it&#8217;s not hard to make the argument that it has on the whole been a net detriment to society. </p><p>And there is still the chance it will pull down the entire economy.</p><p>Buckle up! Turbulence ahead.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://garymarcus.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Bonus: I will return to Open to Debate <a href=\"https://x.com/opentodebateorg/status/2110492383867719699?s=61\">on Tuesday</a> in Baltimore, partnered with Cathy O&#8217;Neil. No public livestream, but there will eventually be edited versions both on YouTube and many NPR affiliates, including WNYC.</p>",
